      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rapid_River%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Indigenous Noquet and Ojibwe peoples originally inhabited the area, with the Ojibwe calling the river Waishka.",
